### 2.3 Use Cases (Pipelines)

#### UpsertBotUseCase — pplication/bot/UpsertBotUseCase.java
Creates or updates a bot; fires BotSavedEvent.

| # | Step | Description |
|---|---|---|
| 1 | NormalizeAndLoadStep | Normalize username, load existing record from DB. |
| 2 | MergeStep | Call ManagedBot.create() or existing.merge(). |
| 3 | PersistStep | Save merged entity to MongoDB. |
| 4 | RefreshCacheStep | Push saved bot into the in-memory BotCache. |
| 5 | PublishEventStep | Publish BotSavedEvent triggering webhook sync. |

#### DeleteBotUseCase — pplication/bot/DeleteBotUseCase.java
Deletes a bot and all related data; fires BotDeletedEvent.

| # | Step | Description |
|---|---|---|
| 1 | LoadStep | Find bot by username; abort if not found. |
| 2 | DeleteActivationsStep | Remove all group activations for this bot. |
| 3 | DeleteBotStep | Delete bot document from MongoDB. |
| 4 | EvictCacheStep | Remove bot from in-memory cache. |
| 5 | PublishDeleteEventStep | Publish BotDeletedEvent triggering webhook de-registration. |

#### GroupBotActivationService — pplication/activation/GroupBotActivationService.java
Manages chat group activations with two independent pipelines.

**Activate Pipeline:**

| # | Step | Description |
|---|---|---|
| 1 | LoadExistingActivationForActivateStep | Load existing record or null. |
| 2 | CheckAlreadyActiveStep | Short-circuit if already active. |
| 3 | SaveActivationStep | Call ctivate() or create new; save. |

**Deactivate Pipeline:**

| # | Step | Description |
|---|---|---|
| 1 | LoadExistingActivationForDeactivateStep | Load existing record; short-circuit if none. |
| 2 | CheckNotActiveStep | Short-circuit if already inactive. |
| 3 | SaveDeactivatedStep | Call deactivate() and save. |

#### BroadcastUseCase — pplication/notification/BroadcastUseCase.java
Fan-out: sends an HTML message to all active groups of a bot.

| # | Step | Description |
|---|---|---|
| 1 | LoadTargetsStep | Query all active GroupActivation for the bot. |
| 2 | ValidateTargetsStep | Short-circuit if target list is empty. |
| 3 | DeliverMessagesStep | Call TelegramGateway.sendHtml() per group. |

