### 3.1 Persistence (MongoDB)

| Class | Location | Description |
|---|---|---|
| MongoBotRepository | infrastructure/persistence/mongo/MongoBotRepository.java | Implements BotRepository port. Delegates to Spring Data ManagedBotDocumentRepository. |
| MongoActivationRepository | infrastructure/persistence/mongo/MongoActivationRepository.java | Implements ActivationRepository port. |
| ManagedBotDocument | .../mongo/impl/ManagedBotDocument.java | MongoDB @Document decoupled from domain entity. |
| GroupActivationDocument | .../mongo/impl/GroupActivationDocument.java | MongoDB @Document for activations. |
