| GroupActivationMapper | .../mongo/impl/GroupActivationMapper.java | Maps GroupActivationDocument to/from GroupActivation. |

### 3.2 Cache

| Class | Location | Description |
|---|---|---|
| ManagedBotRegistry | infrastructure/cache/ManagedBotRegistry.java | Implements BotCache. ConcurrentHashMap warmed on startup via @PostConstruct. Falls back to DB on miss. |

### 3.3 Telegram API Client

| Class | Location | Description |
|---|---|---|
| TelegramClient | infrastructure/telegram/TelegramClient.java | Implements TelegramGateway. Three internal pipelines for sendHtml, setWebhook, deleteWebhook, each guarded by ValidateTokenStep. |

### 3.4 Webhook Lifecycle Manager — TelegramWebhookManager

Listens to @EventListener for domain events and keeps webhook registrations in sync.

**Saved Pipeline (BotSavedEvent):**

| # | Step | Description |
|---|---|---|
| 1 | CheckEnabledStep | If disabled: delete webhook, short-circuit. |
| 2 | CheckPublicUrlStep | If PUBLIC_URL is missing: log warning, short-circuit. |
| 3 | FormatWebhookUrlStep | Build full webhook URL from public URL + username. |
| 4 | RegisterWebhookStep | Call TelegramClient.setWebhook(). |

**Deleted Pipeline (BotDeletedEvent):**

| # | Step | Description |
|---|---|---|
| 1 | DeleteWebhookOnDeleteStep | Call TelegramClient.deleteWebhook(). |

### 3.5 Security

| Class | Location | Description |
|---|---|---|
| HmacSha256SignatureVerifier | infrastructure/security/HmacSha256SignatureVerifier.java | Implements WebhookSignatureVerifier. Constant-time comparison to prevent timing attacks. |

### 3.6 Event Publishing

| Class | Location | Description |
|---|---|---|
| SpringDomainEventPublisher | infrastructure/event/SpringDomainEventPublisher.java | Implements DomainEventPublisher using Spring ApplicationEventPublisher. |

